or Industrial Reliability\\n\\n\",\"header_size\":\"div\",\"align\":\"center\",\"__globals__\":{\"typography_typography\":\"globals/typography?id=secondary\",\"title_color\":\"globals/colors?id=accent\"}},\"elements\":[],\"widgetType\":\"heading\"},{\"id\":\"69edade\",\"elType\":\"widget\",\"settings\":{\"image\":{\"url\":\"https://suriota.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/11/thm-poster.webp\",\"id\":1711,\"size\":\"\",\"alt\":\"\",\"source\":\"library\"}},\"elements\":[],\"widgetType\":\"image\"},{\"id\":\"9ad71a7\",\"elType\":\"widget\",\"settings\":{\"editor\":\"<p>When your operations demand accuracy, stability, and long-term durability, the THM-30MD delivers. Powered by the high-performance SHT30 Sensirion sensor, this device ensures precise environmental monitoring in even the toughest industrial conditions. Protecting your equipment, processes, and products.</p><p><strong>Guard your operations with precise data.</strong><br/>The THM-30MD gives you the insight you need to maintain optimal conditions, maximize efficiency, and protect what matters most.</p>\"},\"elements\":[],\"widgetType\":\"text-editor\"},{\"id\":\"348a240\",\"elType\":\"widget\",\"settings\":{\"html\":\"<section class=\\\"sx-section sx-whyus sx-prod-features\\\">\\n  <div class=\\\"sx-whyus-inner\\\">\\n    <span class=\\\"sx-eyebrow\\\">KEY FEATURES</span>\\n    <h2 class=\\\"sx-whyus-title\\\">Why facility managers choose THM-30MD</h2>\\n    <div class=\\\"sx-whyus-grid\\\">\\n      <article class=\\\"sx-whyus-card\\\"><div class=\\\"sx-whyus-num\\\">01</div><h3 class=\\\"sx-whyus-h3\\\">High-Precision Sensing</h3><p class=\\\"sx-whyus-desc\\\"><strong>±0.3°C / ±2%RH</strong> accuracy across full range. SHT30 Sensirion-grade element with calibration stability over years.</p></article>\\n      <article class=\\\"sx-whyus-card\\\"><div class=\\\"sx-whyus-num\\\">02</div><h3 class=\\\"sx-whyus-h3\\\">Modbus RTU Native</h3><p class=\\\"sx-whyus-desc\\\">Direct <strong>RS-485 Modbus output</strong>. Plug into any PLC, SCADA, BMS, or IoT gateway. Configurable slave ID and baud rate.</p></article>\\n      <article class=\\\"sx-whyus-card\\\"><div class=\\\"sx-whyus-num\\\">03</div><h3 class=\\\"sx-whyus-h3\\\">IP65 Industrial Housing</h3><p class=\\\"sx-whyus-desc\\\"><strong>Dust-tight + jet-water resistant</strong>. Stainless probe for food/pharma cleanroom hygiene. Wall &amp; duct mounting.</p></article>\\n      <article class=\\\"sx-whyus-card\\\"><div class=\\\"sx-whyus-num\\\">04</div><h3 class=\\\"sx-whyus-h3\\\">Wide Operating Range</h3><p class=\\\"sx-whyus-desc\\\"><strong>-40°C to +80°C</strong>, 0-100%RH range. Suitable for cold storage, greenhouse, server rooms, and outdoor enclosures.</p></article>\\n      <article class=\\\"sx-whyus-card\\\"><div class=\\\"sx-whyus-num\\\">05</div><h3 class=\\\"sx-whyus-h3\\\">Wide Supply Voltage</h3><p class=\\\"sx-whyus-desc\\\">Powered by <strong>5-38VDC</strong>. EMC compliant for stable readings without electrical interference in noisy industrial environments.</p></article>\\n      <article class=\\\"sx-whyus-card\\\"><div class=\\\"sx-whyus-num\\\">06</div><h3 class=\\\"sx-whyus-h3\\\">Quick DIN Rail Install</h3><p class=\\\"sx-whyus-desc\\\"><strong>35mm DIN rail mount</strong> for hassle-free panel deployment. Low-power MCU design minimizes drift while saving energy.</p></article>\\n    </div>\\n  </div>\\n</section>\"},\"elements\":[],\"widgetType\":\"html\"},{\"id\":\"903fea4\",\"elType\":\"widget\",\"settings\":{\"html\":\"<div class=\\\"sx-action-group\\\">\\n  <a class=\\\"sx-action-btn sx-action-btn--primary\\\" href=\\\"https://www.tokopedia.com/suriota\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\" rel=\\\"noopener\\\" aria-label=\\\"Order THM-30MD on Tokopedia\\\">\\n    <svg width=\\\"18\\\" height=\\\"18\\\" viewBox=\\\"0 0 24 24\\\" fill=\\\"none\\\" stroke=\\\"currentColor\\\" stroke-width=\\\"2\\\" stroke-linecap=\\\"round\\\" stroke-linejoin=\\\"round\\\" aria-hidden=\\\"true\\\"><circle cx=\\\"9\\\" cy=\\\"21\\\"