tem\\\"><summary>Is it IP-rated for outdoor or wash-down use?</summary><div class=\\\"sx-faq-answer\\\">Yes. IP65 dust-tight and jet-water resistant housing with stainless probe. Suitable for food/pharma cleanroom hygiene, outdoor weather stations, and HVAC duct mounting.</div></details>\\n    <details class=\\\"sx-faq-item\\\"><summary>What is the operating range?</summary><div class=\\\"sx-faq-answer\\\">-40°C to +80°C temperature, 0-100% relative humidity. Wide range supports cold storage, greenhouse, server room, outdoor enclosure, and standard industrial environments.</div></details>\\n  </div>\\n</section>\\n<script type=\\\"application/ld+json\\\">\\n{\\\"@context\\\":\\\"https://schema.org\\\",\\\"@type\\\":\\\"FAQPage\\\",\\\"mainEntity\\\":[\\n{\\\"@type\\\":\\\"Question\\\",\\\"name\\\":\\\"What is the sensor accuracy?\\\",\\\"acceptedAnswer\\\":{\\\"@type\\\":\\\"Answer\\\",\\\"text\\\":\\\"±0.3°C temperature and ±2%RH humidity. Sensirion-grade element with calibration stability over years.\\\"}},\\n{\\\"@type\\\":\\\"Question\\\",\\\"name\\\":\\\"What output protocol does THM-30MD use?\\\",\\\"acceptedAnswer\\\":{\\\"@type\\\":\\\"Answer\\\",\\\"text\\\":\\\"Modbus RTU over RS-485, configurable slave ID and baud rate 4800-115200, plug-and-play with PLC/SCADA/BMS.\\\"}},\\n{\\\"@type\\\":\\\"Question\\\",\\\"name\\\":\\\"Is it IP-rated for outdoor use?\\\",\\\"acceptedAnswer\\\":{\\\"@type\\\":\\\"Answer\\\",\\\"text\\\":\\\"Yes. IP65 dust-tight, jet-water resistant. Stainless probe for cleanroom hygiene. Outdoor and HVAC compatible.\\\"}},\\n{\\\"@type\\\":\\\"Question\\\",\\\"name\\\":\\\"What is the operating range?\\\",\\\"acceptedAnswer\\\":{\\\"@type\\\":\\\"Answer\\\",\\\"text\\\":\\\"-40°C to +80°C, 0-100% RH. Cold storage, greenhouse, server room, outdoor compatible.\\\"}}\\n]}\\n</script>\"},\"elements\":[],\"widgetType\":\"html\"},{\"id\":\"77d97f6\",\"elType\":\"widget\",\"settings\":{\"html\":\"<section class=\\\"sx-cta-final\\\" aria-labell